<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NK Properties warns it in talks.</title>
<headline>NK Properties warns it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property company NK Properties Ltd said on Tuesday it was involved in talks which could affect the company's share price.</p>
<p>It said holders of linked units should exercise caution in share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
